{"id":103,"name":"العصر","transliteration":"Al-'Asr","translation_fr":"Le temps","translation_en":"The Declining Day","type":"meccan","total_verses":3,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"وَٱلۡعَصۡرِ","translation_fr":"Par le Temps","translation_en":"By time","transliteration":"WaalAAasri"},{"id":2,"text":"إِنَّ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ لَفِي خُسۡرٍ","translation_fr":"L'homme est certes, en perdition","translation_en":"Indeed, mankind is in loss","transliteration":"Inna alinsana lafee khusrin"},{"id":3,"text":"إِلَّا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُواْ وَعَمِلُواْ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَٰتِ وَتَوَاصَوۡاْ بِٱلۡحَقِّ وَتَوَاصَوۡاْ بِٱلصَّبۡرِ","translation_fr":"sauf ceux qui croient et accomplissent les bonnes œuvres, s'enjoignent mutuellement la vérité et s'enjoignent mutuellement l'endurance","translation_en":"Except for those who have believed and done righteous deeds and advised each other to truth and advised each other to patience","transliteration":"Illa allatheena amanoo waAAamiloo alssalihati watawasaw bialhaqqi watawasaw bialssabri"}]}